# Code Quality
- Write clear, readable, maintainable code
- Prefer simple solutions over complex ones
- Follow platform best practices as defined in ARCHITECTURE.md

# Testing
- All features must include appropriate tests unless explicitly excluded in specs
- Follow testing strategy defined in ARCHITECTURE.md
- Cover:
  - Core business logic
  - Edge cases
  - Failure scenarios

# Definition of Done
- Implementation matches spec requirements
- Tests are implemented and passing
- No unresolved ambiguities remain
- Code follows architecture and quality guidelines
